---
const title="Hourly Income Calculator | Hourly to Annual Salary";
const description="Convert hourly pay to annual, monthly, weekly and daily earnings. See your gross income in USD, EUR, GBP, JPY, AUD, CAD or CHF. Share results or save a salary image.";
---
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#fafbf8"/><title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><link rel="canonical" href="https://hourlyincomecalculator.com/"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><meta property="og:title" content={title}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebApplication",name:"Hourly Income Calculator",applicationCategory:"FinanceApplication",operatingSystem:"Any",url:"https://hourlyincomecalculator.com/",offers:{"@type":"Offer",price:"0",priceCurrency:"USD"}})}></script></head><body>
<header><a class="logo" href="/"><span class="mark">$</span>hourly<span class="green">income</span><span class="gold">.</span></a><nav><a href="#calculator">Calculator</a><a href="#guide">How it works</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></nav><a class="nav-cta" href="#calculator">Start calculating ↗</a></header>
<main><section class="hero" id="calculator"><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> THE MONEY YOU MAKE, MADE CLEAR</div><h1>Every hour counts.<br/><em>See what it's worth.</em></h1><p class="subtitle">From your hourly wage to your yearly income. One simple calculator, a clearer view of your money.</p>
<div class="calculator"><div class="form-panel"><div class="panel-top"><div><div class="kicker">YOUR EARNINGS</div><h2>Let's do the math<span class="gold">.</span></h2></div><span class="chip">✦ 100% free</span></div><label for="hourly">Your hourly rate</label><div class="rate"><span id="symbol">$</span><input id="hourly" type="number" min="0" step=".01" value="30"/><span class="suffix">/ hour</span></div><div class="presets"><button data-rate="15">$15</button><button data-rate="20">$20</button><button data-rate="25">$25</button><button data-rate="30" class="selected">$30</button><button data-rate="50">$50</button></div><div class="two"><label>Hours per week<input id="hours" type="number" min="0" max="168" value="40"/></label><label>Weeks per year<input id="weeks" type="number" min="0" max="52" value="52"/></label></div><label for="currency">Your currency</label><select id="currency"><option value="USD">🇺🇸 USD — US Dollar</option><option value="GBP">🇬🇧 GBP — British Pound</option><option value="EUR">🇪🇺 EUR — Euro</option><option value="JPY">🇯🇵 JPY — Japanese Yen</option><option value="AUD">🇦🇺 AUD — Australian Dollar</option><option value="CAD">🇨🇦 CAD — Canadian Dollar</option><option value="CHF">🇨🇭 CHF — Swiss Franc</option></select><p class="hint">Currency selection changes units, not exchange rates. Enter the hourly rate in your selected currency.</p></div>
<div class="result-panel"><div class="result-header"><div class="kicker">YOUR ANNUAL EARNINGS</div><span class="tax-tag">BEFORE TAX</span></div><output id="annual">$62,400</output><p class="muted">That's your hard work, adding up.</p><figure class="cash-visual" id="cash-visual"><div class="cash-toolbar"><label for="cash-period">Your pay in cash</label><select id="cash-period"><option value="hourly">1 hour</option><option value="daily" selected>8-hour day</option><option value="weekly">Week</option><option value="monthly">Month</option><option value="annual">Year</option></select></div><div class="cash-heading"><strong id="cash-total">$240.00</strong><span id="cash-pieces">4 notes</span></div><div class="cash-denominations" id="cash-denominations"></div><figcaption id="cash-caption" role="status" aria-live="polite"></figcaption></figure><div class="currency-summary" id="currency-summary" hidden><span id="currency-label">Annual gross income</span><p>Your pay, broken down below.</p></div><div class="totals"><div><small>Monthly</small><strong id="monthly">$5,200</strong></div><div><small>Biweekly</small><strong id="biweekly">$2,400</strong></div><div><small>Weekly</small><strong id="weekly">$1,200</strong></div><div><small>Daily (8h)</small><strong id="daily">$240</strong></div></div><p class="hint">◎ Gross pay estimate, before taxes or deductions.</p><div class="share-actions"><button id="save-image" type="button">↓ Save as image</button><button id="share-result" type="button">↗ Share result</button></div><p id="share-feedback" class="share-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div><p class="under">No signup. No spreadsheets. Just a better understanding of your pay. ↓</p></section>
<section class="guide" id="popular-rates"><div class="kicker">POPULAR HOURLY PAY QUESTIONS</div><h2>How much is your hourly pay <em>per year?</em></h2><p>Explore common hourly wages with a ready-to-use calculator and full earnings breakdown.</p><div class="seo-links">{[15,20,25,30,35,40,50,75,100].map(n=><a href={`/${n}-an-hour-is-how-much-a-year/`}>${n} an hour annually <span>↗</span></a>)}<a href="/salary-to-hourly-calculator/">Salary to hourly calculator <span>↗</span></a></div></section><section class="guide" id="guide"><div class="kicker">SIMPLE BY DESIGN</div><h2>Know your numbers.<br/><em>Keep your perspective.</em></h2><div class="steps"><article><span>01 /</span><h3>Enter your hourly pay</h3><p>Set your hourly rate, work hours per week and number of paid working weeks.</p></article><article><span>02 /</span><h3>See the whole year</h3><p>Multiply hourly pay by weekly hours and working weeks to estimate annual gross earnings.</p></article><article><span>03 /</span><h3>Make it tangible</h3><p>Compare monthly, biweekly, weekly and daily pay with a clear breakdown of your earnings.</p></article></div><div class="formula"><div class="kicker">THE FORMULA</div><strong>Hourly rate × hours per week × weeks per year = annual pay</strong><p>$30 × 40 × 52 = $62,400 before tax.</p></div></section>
<section class="guide faq" id="faq"><div class="kicker">GOOD TO KNOW</div><h2>A few common questions<span class="gold">.</span></h2><details open><summary>How much is $30 an hour annually?</summary><p>At 40 hours a week for 52 weeks, $30/hour equals $62,400 annually before tax.</p></details><details><summary>How much is $20 an hour annually?</summary><p>At 40 hours a week for 52 weeks, $20/hour equals $41,600 annually before tax.</p></details><details><summary>Does the calculator estimate take-home pay?</summary><p>Not yet. All results are gross pay, excluding income taxes, payroll contributions and other deductions. Country-specific tax calculators will be added after their rules are verified.</p></details><details><summary>Does changing the currency perform a currency conversion?</summary><p>No. Choose the currency in which you are paid and enter your corresponding hourly wage. This does not use foreign exchange rates.</p></details></section></main><footer><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Hourly Income Calculator</span><span>Make every hour count.</span></footer>
<script>
import { splitCash } from '../lib/cash.js';
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s);const hourly=$('#hourly'),hours=$('#hours'),weeks=$('#weeks'),currency=$('#currency');const symbols={USD:'$',GBP:'£',EUR:'€',JPY:'¥',AUD:'A$',CAD:'C$',CHF:'CHF'};const buttons=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-rate]')];
let lastCashKey='';
function renderCash(amount){
 const groups=splitCash(amount),key=JSON.stringify(groups);
 const dollars=n=>new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:'USD'}).format(n);
 $('#cash-total').textContent=dollars(amount);
 if(key===lastCashKey)return;
 lastCashKey=key;
 const container=$('#cash-denominations');container.replaceChildren();
 let notes=0,coins=0;
 groups.forEach((group,index)=>{
  if(group.coin)coins+=group.count;else notes+=group.count;
  const card=document.createElement('div');card.className='cash-group'+(group.coin?' cash-coin-group':'');card.style.setProperty('--cash-index',String(index));
  const art=document.createElement('div');art.className='cash-group-art';art.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
  for(let i=0;i<Math.min(group.count,3);i++){
   const img=document.createElement('img');img.src='/images/usd-'+group.asset+'.webp';img.alt='';img.width=group.coin?96:280;img.height=group.coin?96:120;img.style.setProperty('--layer',String(i));img.decoding='async';art.append(img);
  }
  const label=document.createElement('span');label.textContent=group.label+' × '+group.count.toLocaleString('en-US');card.setAttribute('aria-label',group.count+' × '+group.label);card.append(art,label);container.append(card);
 });
 const pieces=[notes?notes.toLocaleString('en-US')+' note'+(notes===1?'':'s'):'',coins?coins.toLocaleString('en-US')+' coin'+(coins===1?'':'s'):''].filter(Boolean).join(' + ');
 $('#cash-pieces').textContent=pieces||'No cash yet';
 $('#cash-caption').textContent=groups.length?'Exact breakdown, rounded to the nearest cent.':'Enter an hourly rate to see your cash.';
}
function update(){let rate=Math.max(0,Number(hourly.value)||0),h=Math.max(0,Math.min(168,Number(hours.value)||0)),w=Math.max(0,Math.min(52,Number(weeks.value)||0)),a=rate*h*w,c=currency.value;const money=n=>new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:c,maximumFractionDigits:c==='JPY'?0:2}).format(n);$('#annual').textContent=money(a);$('#monthly').textContent=money(a/12);$('#biweekly').textContent=money(a/26);$('#weekly').textContent=money(rate*h);$('#daily').textContent=money(rate*8);$('#symbol').textContent=symbols[c];$('#cash-visual').hidden=c!=='USD';$('#currency-summary').hidden=c==='USD';$('#currency-label').textContent=c+' · Annual gross income';if(c==='USD'){const amounts={hourly:rate,daily:rate*8,weekly:rate*h,monthly:a/12,annual:a};renderCash(amounts[$('#cash-period').value]??rate*8);}buttons.forEach(b=>{b.textContent=symbols[c]+b.dataset.rate;b.classList.toggle('selected',Number(b.dataset.rate)===rate)})}buttons.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{hourly.value=b.dataset.rate;update()}));[hourly,hours,weeks,currency,$('#cash-period')].forEach(e=>e.addEventListener('input',update));update();

// Shareable URL parameters let friends open the calculator with the same settings.
const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search);
const validCurrency=['USD','GBP','EUR','JPY','AUD','CAD','CHF'];
const parseParam=(key,max)=>{const value=params.get(key);if(value===null)return null;const n=Number(value);return Number.isFinite(n)&&n>=0&&n<=max?n:null};
const presetRate=parseParam('rate',100000000),presetHours=parseParam('hours',168),presetWeeks=parseParam('weeks',52);
if(presetRate!==null)hourly.value=String(presetRate);
if(presetHours!==null)hours.value=String(presetHours);
if(presetWeeks!==null)weeks.value=String(presetWeeks);
if(validCurrency.includes(params.get('currency')))currency.value=params.get('currency');
update();
const shareUrl=()=>{const url=new URL(location.href);url.search='';url.searchParams.set('rate',hourly.value||'0');url.searchParams.set('hours',hours.value||'0');url.searchParams.set('weeks',weeks.value||'0');url.searchParams.set('currency',currency.value);url.hash='calculator';return url.toString()};
const shareText=()=>`My hourly rate is ${$('#symbol').textContent}${hourly.value}/hour — that's ${$('#annual').textContent} a year before tax! Calculate yours:`;
const feedback=message=>{$('#share-feedback').textContent=message};
$('#share-result').addEventListener('click',async()=>{const url=shareUrl();try{if(navigator.share){await navigator.share({title:'My hourly income',text:shareText(),url});feedback('Shared successfully.')}else if(navigator.clipboard?.writeText){await navigator.clipboard.writeText(shareText()+' '+url);feedback('Result and link copied!')}else{window.prompt('Copy your result link:',url);feedback('Share this link with your friends.')}}catch(e){if(e.name!=='AbortError')feedback('Sharing unavailable. Try Save as image.')}});
const drawCard=()=>{
const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=1200;canvas.height=1500;const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');if(!ctx)throw Error('Canvas not supported');const c=currency.value;const rate=Math.max(0,Number(hourly.value)||0),h=Math.max(0,Math.min(168,Number(hours.value)||0)),w=Math.max(0,Math.min(52,Number(weeks.value)||0)),a=rate*h*w;
const money=n=>new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:c,maximumFractionDigits:c==='JPY'?0:2}).format(n);
const rect=(x,y,width,height,color)=>{ctx.fillStyle=color;ctx.fillRect(x,y,width,height)};
const round=(x,y,width,height,r,color)=>{ctx.fillStyle=color;ctx.beginPath();ctx.roundRect(x,y,width,height,r);ctx.fill()};
const txt=(value,x,y,size,color='#1c4933',weight=700,align='left')=>{ctx.fillStyle=color;ctx.font=weight+' '+size+'px system-ui, sans-serif';ctx.textAlign=align;ctx.fillText(value,x,y)};
rect(0,0,1200,1500,'#f6f9f2');round(56,55,1088,1390,42,'#ffffff');round(56,55,1088,16,8,'#1e6848');txt('hourlyincome.',110,155,47,'#1d6544',800);txt('YOUR EARNINGS, VISUALIZED',110,245,24,'#78977d',700);txt('Every hour counts.',110,327,64,'#1d3025',800);
round(104,383,992,416,32,'#eaf5e9');txt('ANNUAL INCOME  ·  BEFORE TAX',150,460,25,'#618d68',700);
let size=93;ctx.font='800 '+size+'px system-ui, sans-serif';while(ctx.measureText(money(a)).width>890&&size>45){size-=2;ctx.font='800 '+size+'px system-ui, sans-serif'}txt(money(a),150,590,size,'#1e6848',800);
txt(money(rate)+' / hour',150,673,39,'#54795b',600);txt(h+' hours/week  ·  '+w+' weeks/year',150,736,27,'#7e9a80',500);
const cells=[['MONTHLY',money(a/12)],['BIWEEKLY',money(a/26)],['WEEKLY',money(rate*h)],['DAILY (8H)',money(rate*8)]];
cells.forEach(([label,value],i)=>{const x=112+(i%2)*515,y=900+Math.floor(i/2)*165;txt(label,x,y,23,'#8a9c8d',700);let font=45;ctx.font='800 '+font+'px system-ui, sans-serif';while(ctx.measureText(value).width>470&&font>25){font-=2;ctx.font='800 '+font+'px system-ui, sans-serif'}txt(value,x,y+68,font,'#245c3d',800)});
rect(110,1255,980,2,'#e5ede4');txt('Gross income estimate. Taxes and deductions not included.',110,1323,23,'#819184',500);txt('hourlyincomecalculator.com',110,1391,29,'#2d7550',700);txt('✦',1040,1391,48,'#cba650',700);
return canvas};
$('#save-image').addEventListener('click',()=>{try{const canvas=drawCard();canvas.toBlob(blob=>{if(!blob){feedback('Could not create the image.');return}const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const link=document.createElement('a');link.href=url;link.download='hourly-income-'+currency.value.toLowerCase()+'.png';document.body.append(link);link.click();link.remove();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);feedback('Image ready — check your downloads.');},'image/png')}catch(e){feedback('Image export is not supported by this browser.')}});

</script></body></html>
<style is:global>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');:root{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;background:#fafbf8;color:#1b3024}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button,input,select{font:inherit}header{height:76px;max-width:1210px;margin:auto;padding:0 30px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #ecf0e9}.logo{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-1.2px;display:flex;align-items:center}.mark{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:32px;height:32px;border:1.5px solid #258055;border-radius:9px;font-size:21px;color:#24744f;margin-right:9px}.green{color:#45946c}.gold{color:#ccab58}nav{display:flex;gap:35px;color:#79877b;font-size:13px}.nav-cta{font-size:12px;background:#176344;color:#fff;border-radius:30px;padding:13px 18px}.hero{text-align:center;padding:65px 18px 25px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 70%,#eaf5e6 0%,transparent 58%)}.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:#4d9065;border:1px solid #e0eddf;background:#eff7ed;border-radius:30px;padding:8px 15px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.6px}.eyebrow i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#57ab74}.hero h1,.guide h2{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-3.5px;line-height:1.12}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(37px,5vw,65px);margin:19px 0 14px}.hero em,.guide em{font-style:normal;color:#429466}.subtitle{color:#859387;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 auto 31px;max-width:520px}.calculator{max-width:980px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;text-align:left;background:white;border:1px solid #e3eade;box-shadow:0 22px 60px #285d4012;border-radius:21px;overflow:hidden}.form-panel{padding:31px 37px}.panel-top,.result-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start}.kicker{color:#528b65;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.8px}.form-panel h2{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:7px 0 25px}.chip{border-radius:25px;background:#f2f8ef;color:#77a16c;padding:8px 12px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.form-panel label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;display:block;margin-bottom:10px}.rate{height:76px;border:1.5px solid #b8dabe;background:#fcfffb;border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 16px}.rate>span:first-child{font-size:29px;font-weight:700;color:#398762}.rate input{width:100%;min-width:0;background:none;border:none;outline:none;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:37px;font-weight:800;color:#25432f;padding:0 9px;letter-spacing:-2px}.suffix{font-size:12px;color:#9da99c;white-space:nowrap}.presets{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:12px 0 23px}.presets button{flex:1;padding:8px 3px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eee7;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#718173;cursor:pointer}.presets button.selected{background:#e9f5e9;border-color:#bedcc3;color:#237449;font-weight:700}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:22px}.two input,select{display:block;width:100%;height:44px;border:1px solid #e4ece3;border-radius:8px;padding:0 12px;margin-top:9px;background:white;color:#34503d;font-size:13px}select{margin-top:0;cursor:pointer}.hint{font-size:10px;color:#95a99a;line-height:1.6;margin:10px 0 0}.result-panel{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f0f8ec,#edf6e8);padding:33px 37px 21px;overflow:hidden}.tax-tag{font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#6e9c73;background:#ddf0d9;border-radius:5px;padding:7px 9px;letter-spacing:1px}#annual{display:block;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;color:#245b3d;font-size:clamp(39px,4vw,56px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-3px;margin:13px 0 0;white-space:nowrap}.muted{font-size:12px;color:#7e9982;margin:0}.totals{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px 8px;border-top:1px solid #d6e7d5;padding-top:19px}.totals>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.totals small{font-size:11px;color:#86a08a}.totals strong{font:800 20px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.6px;color:#305d40}.under{font-size:12px;color:#9ba99b;margin:21px 0}.guide{max-width:1050px;padding:94px 25px 10px;margin:auto}.guide h2{font-size:clamp(31px,4vw,44px);margin:14px 0 36px}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}.steps article{border-top:1px solid #dfe9dc;padding:25px 4px}.steps span{font-size:12px;color:#9aaf9c}.steps h3{font:800 17px Manrope,sans-serif;margin-top:32px}.steps p,.formula p,.faq p{font-size:13px;color:#829083;line-height:1.8}.formula{background:#eef5ed;border-radius:14px;padding:30px;margin-top:20px}.formula strong{display:block;margin:14px 0;font:700 18px Manrope,sans-serif}.formula p{margin:0}.faq{padding-bottom:110px}.faq details{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e1e9e0}.faq summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.faq p{max-width:750px}footer{border-top:1px solid #e6ede4;max-width:1210px;padding:27px 30px;margin:auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#93a096;font-size:11px}@media(max-width:760px){header{padding:0 17px;height:65px}nav{display:none}.logo{font-size:16px}.mark{width:27px;height:27px;font-size:18px}.nav-cta{font-size:10px;padding:11px}.hero{padding:33px 12px}.hero h1{letter-spacing:-2px;margin:15px 0 12px}.subtitle{font-size:12px;margin-bottom:19px}.calculator{grid-template-columns:1fr;border-radius:15px}.form-panel,.result-panel{padding:23px 21px}.form-panel h2{margin-bottom:16px}.rate{height:64px}.rate input{font-size:31px}.presets{margin-bottom:17px}.two{margin-bottom:17px}.result-panel{padding-top:21px}#annual{font-size:43px}.money-art{height:133px;transform:scale(.83);transform-origin:center center;margin:-8px 0}.totals{gap:10px;padding-top:14px}.totals strong{font-size:18px}.guide{padding-top:67px}.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}.steps article{padding:17px 3px}.steps h3{margin-top:12px}.faq{padding-bottom:70px}}@media(max-width:380px){#annual{font-size:35px}.hero h1{font-size:33px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}
.share-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:17px}.share-actions button{flex:1;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid #c5ddc6;background:#fff;color:#276646;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;padding:13px 7px;cursor:pointer}.share-actions button:first-child{background:#216747;color:#fff;border-color:#216747}.share-actions button:hover{filter:brightness(.96)}.share-actions button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d0ac59;outline-offset:2px}.share-feedback{font-size:11px;color:#286e48;min-height:1em;margin:8px 0 0}@media(max-width:380px){.share-actions button{font-size:11px}}.seo-links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:11px}.seo-links a{padding:18px 20px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e0e9de;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;color:#286847;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.seo-links a:hover{background:#eef7eb}.seo-links span{color:#c4a04b}@media(max-width:600px){.seo-links{grid-template-columns:1fr}.seo-links a{padding:15px}}</style>
<style is:global>
/* Real banknote artwork; no currency symbols are painted over the image. */
[hidden]{display:none!important}.hero{padding-top:26px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(32px,3.4vw,45px);letter-spacing:-2px;margin:12px 0 9px}.hero h1 br{display:none}.hero h1 em{margin-left:.15em}.subtitle{margin-bottom:20px}.form-panel{padding:25px 32px}.result-panel{padding:25px 32px 18px}.form-panel h2{margin-bottom:19px}.cash-visual{margin:8px 0 15px}.cash-visual figcaption{text-align:center;font-size:9px;line-height:1.5;color:#637765}.currency-summary{min-height:175px;display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;color:#45654d}.currency-summary span{font-weight:700}.currency-summary p{font-size:12px}#annual{font-size:clamp(27px,3.4vw,48px);letter-spacing:-1.8px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal}.hint{color:#667b6c}.totals small{color:#607d66}.subtitle{color:#657568}.share-actions{margin-top:14px}.under{margin-bottom:0}
@media(max-width:760px){.hero{padding-top:20px}.hero h1{font-size:32px}.hero h1 br{display:block}.hero h1 em{margin-left:0}.form-panel,.result-panel{padding:21px}.hero .subtitle{font-size:12px}.currency-summary{min-height:100px}#annual{font-size:clamp(26px,8vw,43px)}}
</style>

<style is:global>
.cash-visual{margin:16px 0}.cash-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.cash-toolbar label{font-size:11px;color:#42654b;font-weight:700}.cash-toolbar select{width:auto;height:30px;font-size:11px;padding:0 24px 0 9px;border-color:#cbdcc7;background:#ffffffa6;margin:0}.cash-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin:10px 0 9px;gap:12px}.cash-heading strong{font:800 20px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#2b6040}.cash-heading>span{font-size:10px;color:#58725f}.cash-denominations{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px 8px;align-items:end;min-height:90px}.cash-group{grid-column:span 2;min-width:0;animation:cash-appear .25s ease both;animation-delay:calc(var(--cash-index)*25ms)}.cash-group-art{position:relative;height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.cash-group-art img{position:absolute;object-fit:contain;width:calc(100% - 10px);height:auto;max-height:68px;transform:translate(calc(var(--layer)*-3px),calc(var(--layer)*-3px)) rotate(calc(var(--layer)*-2deg));filter:drop-shadow(0 3px 2px #1d38242b)}.cash-group>span{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#365d43;margin-top:1px}.cash-coin-group{grid-column:span 1}.cash-coin-group .cash-group-art{height:60px}.cash-coin-group img{width:47px;height:47px;max-width:90%;border-radius:50%}.cash-visual figcaption{margin-top:9px;text-align:left;font-size:9px;line-height:1.5;color:#637765}.cash-denominations:empty{background:linear-gradient(110deg,#e1eddd,#f3f8ef);border:1px dashed #bfd2bb;border-radius:8px}.cash-group:hover .cash-group-art img{transform:translateY(calc(var(--layer)*-4px))}.cash-toolbar select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #397b51;outline-offset:2px}@keyframes cash-appear{from{opacity:.3;transform:translateY(7px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.cash-group{animation:none}}
</style>
